From 6fd6a1b5ae0b5ce5dfe4b361c125607fb3a737e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 13:56:47 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 012/638] headless: bound the initial AROS content graph
 [chromium] [aros]

AI_PHASE: chromium-headless-bringup

AI_STATUS: wip

ROOT_CAUSE: The default headless and content-shell graph pulled browser-test telemetry, Breakpad symbol tools, Views-only eye-dropper UI, and crash-key implementations before AROS had the corresponding process, UI, and crash backends.

FIX_REASON: Keep the production headless/content dependencies while excluding test-only and toolkit-specific branches on AROS; use crash-key stubs until OPAL-backed crash metadata is wired into Chromium.

SCOPE: headless, content shell/test, crash common, and eye-dropper GN dependency selection.

VALIDATION: GN generates //headless:headless_shell and the build has progressed through more than a thousand generated and compiled actions; final executable link remains in progress.

RISK: medium; this deliberately omits test-support and desktop-only features from the first headless milestone, but does not claim those capabilities are complete.

AI_DECISION_CHAIN: ACD-chromium-native-port-roadmap
---
 components/crash/core/common/BUILD.gn |  2 +-
 components/eye_dropper/BUILD.gn       | 42 ++++++++++++++-------------
 content/shell/BUILD.gn                |  8 ++---
 content/test/BUILD.gn                 | 21 ++++++++------
 headless/BUILD.gn                     |  5 +++-
 5 files changed, 43 insertions(+), 35 deletions(-)

diff --git a/components/crash/core/common/BUILD.gn b/components/crash/core/common/BUILD.gn
index 184a950f01..15c8ce5e77 100644
